    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Stylish and Versatile 4 Bed Residence In Mature and Established Area\n\nLocated within the ever popular and highly sought-after Southknock development, the sale of number 40 offers buyers an excellent opportunity to acquire a home which has been thoughtfully extended and comprehensively modernised in recent years, creating a stylish and exceptionally versatile property that combines character with contemporary living. The generous and well-appointed accommodation extends to c. 155 sq m briefly comprises a bright and welcoming entrance hall, living room with open fire, cosy sitting room with stove insert and a spacious contemporary kitchen/diner which provides an exceptional space for everyday family living and entertaining. A well-equipped utility room and full bathroom with freestanding bath complete the ground floor. On the first floor there are three bedrooms and a shower room, while the top floor is occupied by a spacious fourth bedroom. Outside, there is off-street parking to the front and a sheltered south-facing garden to the rear, with an abundance of mature greenery providing a high degree of privacy together with a patio area ideal for al fresco dining. The mature and well-established setting is within walking distance of a host of amenities, including New Ross Rugby Club and The Brandon House Hotel, while a wide selection of schools and the town centre are all within easy reach. Early viewing is highly recommended.\n\nAccommodation\nEntrance Hall 7.9x 1.9m with tiled floor \nLivingroom 4.1m x 3.5m with open fire\nSittingroom 3.5m x 3m with stove insert \nKitchen/ Diner 5.9m x 4.5m with range of fitted units and tiled floor \nUtility room 2.8m x 2.7m\nBathroom 2.8m x 2.4m\n\nFirst floor\nBedroom 1. 4.7m x 3.2m\nBedroom 2. 3.1m x 2.2m\nBedroom 3. 3.5m x 2m\nShower room 1.9m x 1.7m\n\nSecond floor\nBedroom 4. 7.8m x 3m \n \nOUTSIDE: Off street park and sheltered south facing rear garden \nSERVICES: All main services and O.F.C.H.\nBER: B3 No 117993329\nEIRCODE: Y34N500\nVIEWING: By prior appointment\n\n"
      },
